    "created_at": "2020-07-11T13:10:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-07-11T13:10:26Z",
    "body": "I don't fully understand about 'import', but I totally agree that 'eval's incumbent must be the realm of the caller of 'setTimeout'.  Thus, I agree with the test.\r\n\r\nAFAIK, in Chromium, setTimeout + IDL callback function already supports the backup incumbent stack, so probably this is @hiroshige-g's area, I think?",
