    "body": "> I think it is never null. By \"incumbent's execution context\" you probably mean the execution context in step 1 of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#incumbent-settings-object? In that case then it is definitely never null.\r\n\r\nYes, I meant it, and I had the same idea with yours.  That's a good news that we can avoid increase of memory consumption about IDL callbacks.  :)  Then, I have no concern on this PR.",
