    "body": "> +1 for making active script the ScriptOrModule component of the incumbent.\r\n\r\nThis change will require more 262-side changes, @syg. In particular https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-getactivescriptormodule would not longer be the correct algorithm; we'd need instead to skip execution contexts whose skip-when-determining-incumbent counter is non-zero.",
